    414  7368							; player is A + 3, of a missile or the ball A + 2. Takes one
    415  7368							; line: the WSYNC, then 15 pixels per 5 cycles.
    416  7368							; (its loop in one page: a branch that crosses one takes a
    417  7368							; cycle more, and the column would be wrong; the padding
    418  7368							; comes after an rts)
